WEBVTT

00:00.600 --> 00:05.600
Prétear

00:28.770 --> 00:30.480
Oh, I'm drifting away in the crowd of people...

00:30.480 --> 00:32.180
...and will arrive in an unfamiliar seaport town,

00:32.180 --> 00:33.770
...where I'll meet the wandering Madros!

00:34.680 --> 00:36.780
Ma'am! Miss Mayune!

00:36.780 --> 00:38.280
Miss Mawata! Miss Himeno!

00:38.280 --> 00:39.480
Everyone else!

00:39.480 --> 00:41.220
I shall definitely be on my way!

00:41.220 --> 00:43.890
Definitely, definitely, definitely on my way!

00:43.890 --> 00:45.980
Please do not forget me!

00:48.760 --> 00:52.560
Great Tree of Fenrir, obey my bidding.

00:52.560 --> 00:55.230
Take all the Leafe in this world by force...

00:55.230 --> 00:59.100
...and turn it into a world of death engulfed in darkness!

01:03.740 --> 01:07.200
Warmth, Once More

01:07.610 --> 01:09.780
Please give Mawata back!

01:09.780 --> 01:11.820
It's too late now.

01:11.820 --> 01:14.790
Mawata will soon be completely absorbed by this tree.

01:14.790 --> 01:16.350
No one can stop that!

01:16.350 --> 01:17.460
No...

01:17.460 --> 01:21.860
Those whose loved ones have died possess deep loneliness and despair.

01:21.860 --> 01:25.730
That is the source of power for the
Great Tree of Fenrir.

01:26.430 --> 01:28.570
Hence, thanks to the Great Tree,

01:28.570 --> 01:32.590
...Mawata will be liberated from her suffering for all eternity!

01:33.270 --> 01:34.600
Mawata!

01:36.110 --> 01:39.380
That's not true! Mawata will come back!

01:39.380 --> 01:41.570
She will! Because she's family!

01:43.380 --> 01:45.780
Do feel free to put up a useless struggle.

01:54.330 --> 01:55.320
Himeno!

01:57.430 --> 01:58.990
I as well!
Me too!

01:59.970 --> 02:00.830
Let's go!

02:01.970 --> 02:02.470
Us too!

02:02.470 --> 02:03.400
Hold it!
Us too!

02:09.570 --> 02:10.670
Mawata!

02:21.190 --> 02:22.150
Wait!

02:24.420 --> 02:25.860
Everyone!

02:25.860 --> 02:26.660
Why?

02:26.660 --> 02:28.260
We'll go too.

02:28.260 --> 02:29.960
We want to help Mawata.

02:29.960 --> 02:31.660
But it's dangerous!

02:31.660 --> 02:34.030
I'm not letting you say anything!

02:34.870 --> 02:37.130
Mawata is MY little sister.

02:37.770 --> 02:39.130
Mayune...

02:41.640 --> 02:43.110
To the city?

02:43.880 --> 02:46.010
You treating us like little kids again?!

02:46.010 --> 02:47.480
That's not it.

02:47.480 --> 02:51.180
It's your job to help the citizens evacuate.

02:52.080 --> 02:55.550
Well? This is a job children can't do, isn't it?

02:55.550 --> 02:56.760
Well, yeah...

02:56.760 --> 02:58.260
You're right.

02:58.260 --> 03:00.720
Seems like a mission for an adult.

03:01.760 --> 03:02.820
Mannen...

03:04.960 --> 03:06.590
We're counting on you.

03:09.070 --> 03:10.170
Got it.

03:10.170 --> 03:11.330
All right, let's go!

03:14.640 --> 03:16.510
This is how it should be, right?

03:16.510 --> 03:20.780
If all the Knights fall, that will be the end of the world.

03:20.780 --> 03:21.940
Well, let's get go...

03:30.720 --> 03:32.160
Sorry for being late!

03:32.690 --> 03:34.890
Thanks, Kei, Go!

03:37.660 --> 03:38.460
What's that?

03:38.460 --> 03:40.070
There's something coming from that way too!

03:40.070 --> 03:41.330
You're kidding me!

03:42.470 --> 03:44.170
We'll handle things here.

03:44.170 --> 03:45.530
Himeno, take care of Mawata!

03:46.500 --> 03:47.840
Yeah! Thanks!

03:59.820 --> 04:00.820
Mawata!

04:02.320 --> 04:03.380
You!

04:15.870 --> 04:18.270
Mawata! Say something!

04:16.270 --> 04:18.270
Mawata! Mawata!

04:18.270 --> 04:19.530
Mawata!

04:24.180 --> 04:26.170
I can hear the pulse of darkness.

04:27.580 --> 04:31.070
The pulse which invites the world to eternal darkness.

04:32.620 --> 04:34.990
Everything is happening as you wished.

04:34.990 --> 04:38.820
Soon, this world will be engulfed in darkness.

04:39.560 --> 04:43.580
The world which wounded me and made me suffer will soon crumble.

04:44.230 --> 04:48.100
Soon, no one will get hurt nor suffer.

04:49.030 --> 04:50.400
Nor love...

04:55.340 --> 04:57.470
I feel as though my heart will dance!

05:15.090 --> 05:16.220
Mawata!

05:19.130 --> 05:21.290
Mawata! Come back!

05:22.070 --> 05:24.500
Get a hold of yourself! Mawata!

05:26.600 --> 05:28.440
Mawata!

05:48.160 --> 05:50.020
I wonder if it's about time?

05:50.760 --> 05:54.630
Do you think they're about to give up, Sasame?

05:57.570 --> 06:01.010
Give up and begrudge me and Sasame.

06:03.240 --> 06:06.730
Begrudge, hate, and fall into despair.

06:09.080 --> 06:14.780
Then everyone can be the Great Tree of Fenrir's new puppets.

06:20.530 --> 06:21.790
Why?

06:22.960 --> 06:24.960
Why won't they give up?!

06:24.960 --> 06:28.090
That can't be right! That can't be...

06:29.070 --> 06:31.070
I refuse to recognize your efforts!

06:31.070 --> 06:32.300
Yes...

06:33.640 --> 06:35.040
Leave it to me.

06:41.710 --> 06:42.480
Himeno!

06:49.890 --> 06:51.020
Sasame!

06:51.020 --> 06:54.090
The will of the Great Tree of Fenrir will not stop.

06:54.090 --> 06:57.190
Not until it absorbs all the Leafe this world has to offer.

06:57.860 --> 07:00.170
You shouldn't try anything that's of no use.

07:00.170 --> 07:02.830
Or shall I just end it with my sword?

07:02.830 --> 07:04.670
Your opponent is me!

07:04.670 --> 07:05.690
Himeno!

07:10.410 --> 07:11.980
I'll be all right.

07:11.980 --> 07:14.180
There's no need to worry about me.

07:14.180 --> 07:17.480
Please look after Mawata, Dad, Mom!

07:18.580 --> 07:19.780
Himeno...

07:22.220 --> 07:23.690
Be careful!

07:26.320 --> 07:27.290
I will!

07:41.270 --> 07:43.040
Aren't you going to use a sword?

07:44.840 --> 07:46.780
Hayate's the only one who's going to get hurt.

07:49.580 --> 07:51.980
Don't you hate me?

07:51.980 --> 07:55.990
Of course I do! You made Mawata go through all that!

07:55.990 --> 08:00.820
You don't understand how she feels, nor my feelings, nor Takako's.

08:01.860 --> 08:07.030
Sixteen years ago, I used my powers to help seal Takako.

08:07.030 --> 08:10.370
I made myself believe that was a Knight's mission...

08:10.370 --> 08:13.570
...and sealed the woman I loved into the darkness.

08:13.570 --> 08:16.980
Ever since that day, no matter how many people's hearts I soothed,

08:16.980 --> 08:19.510
...my own heart was never soothed.

08:19.510 --> 08:22.210
That doesn't mean Mawata should have to...

08:22.210 --> 08:24.780
Her heart was screaming.

08:24.780 --> 08:28.590
Her postcards painfully communicated her messages,

08:28.590 --> 08:32.520
...but neither you nor her family bothered to save her.

08:32.520 --> 08:35.190
That's because I didn't realize it.

08:35.190 --> 08:37.960
That's why I saved her.

08:37.960 --> 08:40.570
She probably hates me now.

08:40.570 --> 08:45.400
That's all right. I've been thinking as I suffered,

08:46.170 --> 08:49.010
...how much easier it would be if I could hate Hayate.

08:49.010 --> 08:50.240
That's not...

08:50.980 --> 08:55.480
Miss Mawata will be liberated from her suffering by hating me.

08:55.480 --> 08:57.180
Her pain will be eased.

08:57.180 --> 08:59.380
That's not true!

08:59.380 --> 09:01.020
It's not true.

09:01.020 --> 09:03.790
That's not what she wanted!

09:03.790 --> 09:07.060
She only wanted someone to be near her!

09:07.060 --> 09:09.760
She wanted someone to tell her she's not alone!

09:09.760 --> 09:11.090
She was...

09:13.670 --> 09:15.720
She was in love with you!

09:17.170 --> 09:20.870
But all you did was to manipulate and use her!

09:20.870 --> 09:23.000
You didn't save her at all!

09:34.720 --> 09:35.990
Hayate!

09:35.990 --> 09:37.420
I'm all right.

09:38.160 --> 09:39.660
Hayate!

09:39.660 --> 09:41.430
You can hear me, can't you?

09:41.430 --> 09:45.890
If you don't want Himeno to get hurt, undo the prét and fight me!

09:48.670 --> 09:50.230
No, Hayate!

09:50.230 --> 09:54.640
If we don't have the power of Prétear, there's no way we can win against Sasame!

09:54.640 --> 09:58.040
But if I win, Himeno will die as well.

10:03.880 --> 10:06.250
No! Hayate!

10:07.020 --> 10:07.990
No!

10:13.890 --> 10:15.260
Why?

10:16.230 --> 10:19.890
When this battle's over, there's something I want to tell you.

10:20.930 --> 10:22.020
That's why...

10:23.230 --> 10:24.790
I'll definitely come back.

10:29.770 --> 10:30.870
I understand.

10:38.180 --> 10:41.240
It needs to be finished. This needs to come to an end.

10:42.720 --> 10:43.980
I'll see to it!

10:49.260 --> 10:50.360
Hurry and escape!

10:50.360 --> 10:51.160
Escape!

10:51.160 --> 10:51.890
This way!

10:53.430 --> 10:55.090
Damn, this is endless!

11:20.430 --> 11:21.590
I won't give up!

11:22.860 --> 11:24.230
Don't give up!

11:26.960 --> 11:28.900
Foolish, weak humans.

11:30.440 --> 11:33.300
It's of no use, nothing is anymore.

11:35.140 --> 11:37.940
No one can withstand the will of the Great Tree.

11:40.210 --> 11:43.480
All one can do is to wait until that very moment.

12:00.930 --> 12:05.770
Stupid girl, to come before me in your human form.

12:05.770 --> 12:07.470
What do you intend to do?

12:07.470 --> 12:08.910
Please...

12:08.910 --> 12:12.140
Please stop all this!

12:13.310 --> 12:14.780
Doing this...

12:14.780 --> 12:18.480
Will destroying the world really heal the wounds in your heart?

12:18.480 --> 12:23.280
You wouldn't understand the feelings of someone who was betrayed by a loved one like myself!

12:25.090 --> 12:28.160
Did Hayate really betray you?

12:28.160 --> 12:29.460
What?!

12:29.460 --> 12:31.360
You know, don't you?

12:31.360 --> 12:34.170
That Hayate's not a person capable of that!

12:34.170 --> 12:38.330
That Hayate's been blaming himself for having turned you into the Princess of Disaster!

12:39.640 --> 12:42.170
He doesn't care about what happens to him.

12:42.170 --> 12:44.140
A guy like him isn't capable of betraying...

12:44.140 --> 12:45.110
Shut up!

12:52.280 --> 12:53.340
Anyone...

12:53.890 --> 12:57.960
...can hurt someone else as long as they're alive,

12:57.960 --> 13:03.160
...but if you're scared of that, you can't trust anyone.

13:03.160 --> 13:07.970
Even family, even friends, there are times you hurt one another,

13:07.970 --> 13:12.070
...but they believe in each other so they can start over and over again!

13:12.070 --> 13:14.940
Family? Friends?

13:26.920 --> 13:30.620
Family and friends believing in one another?

13:30.620 --> 13:35.390
How many times do you think I've been betrayed by them?

13:35.390 --> 13:39.800
Even you were plagued by loneliness when you arrived at that house.

13:40.530 --> 13:45.170
Back then, I certainly couldn't adjust to my new life.

13:45.170 --> 13:49.110
I tried too hard and ended up building a wall.

13:49.110 --> 13:54.180
I may not have tried to believe, but it's different now. I believe now.

13:54.180 --> 13:58.340
Then I'll show you. The true identity of what you believe in!

14:05.290 --> 14:06.760
Great Tree of Fenrir!

14:11.960 --> 14:13.090
Stop!

14:19.270 --> 14:23.500
Now, run away and leave Mawata behind.

14:25.180 --> 14:26.340
Everyone...

14:29.580 --> 14:31.380
I won't be defeated.

14:32.820 --> 14:37.690
Himeno trusted us to look after Mawata!

14:37.690 --> 14:39.360
That's right!

14:39.360 --> 14:41.830
I'll show you, Himeno!

14:48.130 --> 14:50.670
Mawata! Wait there!

14:50.670 --> 14:52.570
We'll save you!

14:52.570 --> 14:56.840
We're really putting our all into this, so respond already!

14:59.780 --> 15:00.870
Mawata!

15:14.490 --> 15:17.330
Mawata! Mawata!

15:17.330 --> 15:20.160
Shut up, leave me alone.

15:20.160 --> 15:23.430
I don't need anything anymore. Everyone should just disappear.

15:24.370 --> 15:25.630
Everyone...

15:26.570 --> 15:28.560
Right, Father?

15:29.510 --> 15:32.170
Mawata! Mawata!

15:39.780 --> 15:41.050
Mawata!

15:46.490 --> 15:49.020
Mawata, let's go home.

15:51.560 --> 15:54.370
What are you doing, Great Tree of Fenrir?!

15:54.370 --> 15:56.700
Dispose of them!

15:59.570 --> 16:03.970
Mawata, what you want isn't a cold place like this, is it?

16:03.970 --> 16:07.080
I don't want any more pain or suffering!

16:07.080 --> 16:09.380
No more! Leave me alone!

16:09.380 --> 16:16.090
I'm sorry I didn't realize it sooner, but I won't make that mistake anymore.

16:16.090 --> 16:20.110
You clearly said how you really feel, so everyone...

16:21.630 --> 16:26.960
Everyone wants to know more about how you feel.

16:26.960 --> 16:29.900
Everyone's waiting. You're not alone.

16:35.240 --> 16:36.370
Mayune...

16:36.370 --> 16:38.140
Mother...

16:38.140 --> 16:42.240
Mawata, what do you really want?

16:44.280 --> 16:46.040
A warm...

16:48.120 --> 16:50.420
A warm hand.

16:50.420 --> 16:52.360
Mawata!

16:59.230 --> 17:00.220
What the?!

17:00.830 --> 17:01.890
Look!

17:03.430 --> 17:04.900
What's going on?

17:06.040 --> 17:08.330
The tree's power is growing weaker.

17:08.810 --> 17:11.040
I feel it. I feel the tree's heart.

17:12.380 --> 17:13.780
What's this, all of a sudden?!

17:28.690 --> 17:29.780
Mawata!

17:43.340 --> 17:44.980
Thank goodness.

17:44.980 --> 17:46.500
No...

17:47.380 --> 17:48.980
It can't be!

17:48.980 --> 17:51.020
Mawata's smiling.

17:51.020 --> 17:53.280
That can't be.

17:53.280 --> 17:56.620
She's much more miserable than me.

17:56.620 --> 17:57.990
What?

17:57.990 --> 17:59.220
That's right.

17:59.220 --> 18:03.360
She's much more miserable and pitiable than I was sixteen years ago.

18:03.360 --> 18:05.530
She can't possibly smile!

18:05.530 --> 18:08.470
Hate more, begrudge more!

18:08.470 --> 18:11.770
No one loves you.

18:11.770 --> 18:13.040
No one...

18:13.040 --> 18:14.230
She's...

18:15.170 --> 18:17.440
No matter how hard you try,

18:18.380 --> 18:20.370
...you won't be loved!

18:21.010 --> 18:22.950
Don't go, Mawata!

18:23.580 --> 18:26.070
Don't leave me all by myself!

18:29.190 --> 18:30.480
Sasame...

18:30.990 --> 18:33.290
Sasame, where are you?

18:33.290 --> 18:35.290
You're here, aren't you? Answer me!

18:35.290 --> 18:38.780
Sasame! Sasame!

18:45.340 --> 18:46.700
Hayate!

18:52.410 --> 18:53.670
Hang on!

18:54.410 --> 18:55.480
Takako...

18:55.480 --> 18:56.950
Sasame!

18:57.480 --> 18:59.450
Hayate! Hayate!

19:01.590 --> 19:03.580
Himeno...

19:04.320 --> 19:05.380
Hayate!

19:06.120 --> 19:09.520
Kill those two right now.

19:14.230 --> 19:17.790
Hurry! You love me, don't you?!

19:23.040 --> 19:24.880
You've got it wrong, Sasame.

19:24.880 --> 19:28.830
That is not what you need to do now.

19:29.680 --> 19:32.050
You want to save Takako, don't you?

19:32.580 --> 19:34.680
What are you doing?! Hurry!

19:35.490 --> 19:39.560
Takako didn't really want to become the Princess of Disaster.

19:39.560 --> 19:42.460
She doesn't want to stay one!

19:42.460 --> 19:47.870
I was afraid when I thought I might become the Princess of Disaster.

19:47.870 --> 19:49.830
I didn't know what to do.

19:52.640 --> 19:54.570
I think Takako's the same.

19:54.570 --> 19:57.370
She's scared. She's suffering.

19:57.370 --> 19:59.840
She wants someone to understand!

20:02.880 --> 20:05.640
So you too after all...

20:06.180 --> 20:07.420
Takako?

20:07.420 --> 20:09.590
Everyone abandons me.

20:09.590 --> 20:11.290
No one loves me.

20:11.290 --> 20:13.320
Takako, that's not true!

20:13.320 --> 20:14.850
Just like that time...

20:16.890 --> 20:18.000
What's up, Shin?

20:18.000 --> 20:21.520
Someone's sucking in Leafe, so the Great Tree is getting angry!

20:23.230 --> 20:24.330
Takako!

21:10.410 --> 21:14.040
I am a Knight just for you.

21:23.490 --> 21:29.190
Staring out the window of a room with the lights off

21:23.490 --> 21:29.190
akari o keshita heya no mado kara miru

21:29.190 --> 21:33.430
The stars shine in the night sky

21:29.190 --> 21:33.430
yozora ni hoshi ga hikaru

21:33.430 --> 21:39.300
Today will definitely be a search for your constellation

21:33.430 --> 21:39.300
kyo koso anata no seiza sagashi

21:39.300 --> 21:42.170
To give you an arbitrary jinx

21:39.300 --> 21:42.170
katte na jinkusu

21:42.170 --> 21:48.150
If you find the seventh star, then it's the Lucky Star

21:42.170 --> 21:48.150
nanatsume no hoshi o mitsuketara <i>Lucky</i> <i>Star</i>

21:48.150 --> 21:52.120
Tomorrow, with a happy face

21:48.150 --> 21:52.120
ashita wa egao de

21:52.120 --> 21:58.220
I'll greet you good morning

21:52.120 --> 21:58.220
ohayoutte koe o kakete ageru wa

21:58.220 --> 22:02.530
It's a special thing you can't do anything about

21:58.220 --> 22:02.530
shikatanai tokubetsu

22:02.530 --> 22:03.890
My Sweet Heart

22:02.530 --> 22:03.890
My Sweet Heart

22:03.890 --> 22:10.200
I can't be the only one engrossed in all of this

22:03.890 --> 22:10.200
watashi bakari ga muchuu da nante masaka

22:10.200 --> 22:13.970
It just can't be, and I won't stand for it

22:10.200 --> 22:13.970
arienai yurusenai

22:13.970 --> 22:20.980
I want to see what you're feeling in your heart

22:13.970 --> 22:20.980
anata no naka no kimochi nozokitai

22:20.980 --> 22:29.320
To do it secretly, without you knowing

22:20.980 --> 22:29.320
kizukarenai you ni naisho de

22:41.570 --> 22:44.170
I want to see everyone smile again!

22:44.170 --> 22:45.680
So I won't be beaten!

22:45.680 --> 22:47.950
I don't care if I use up all my power!

22:47.810 --> 22:50.740
The Legend of White Snow

22:47.950 --> 22:50.380
I definitely don't want to be beaten!
